            "text":"Prologue::nl:nlMr. Bennet: Lydia ran off with Wickham?!:nl:nlColonel Foster: That’s what the letter I received indicated.:nl:nlMrs. Bennet: Oh lord! She’s going to die!:nl:nlMr. Bennet: (Why did I marry this woman) Don’t worry, I’ll find her.\\Mrs. Bennet: No don’t go you’ll get into a fight with wickham and you’ll die too!:nl:nlMr. Bennet: (I need to get away from this woman) I need to do this, to protect our family’s honour.\\And so the adventure begins…"
        }}]},

