        {"staticObjects":[],"dynamicObjects":[{"objectId":"story_dialogue","position":{"x":140,"y":-28},"objectData":{
            "text":"(Mr. Bennet notices an officer standing in the road and approaches him):nl:nlMr. Bennet: I am looking for my daughter. Have you seen her?:nl:nlOfficer Brian: I haven’t seen a lady since my mother passed, but I have seen another officer pass through.:nl:nlMr. Bennet: An officer?:nl:nlOfficer Brian: Yeah, he was with a girl, I think, she looked elated, staring at that officer.\\Mr. Bennet: Sounds like Lydia, which way did they go?:nl:nlOfficer Brian: I saw them head that way.:nl:nlMr. Bennet: I offer you my most sincere thanks and gratitude.:nl:nl(Mr. Bennet then runs off in the direction that the officer indicated)"
        }}]},

