        {"staticObjects":[],"dynamicObjects":[{"objectId":"story_dialogue","position":{"x":140,"y":-28},"objectData":{
            "text":"(Mr. Bennet approaches a man but doesn’t bother to ask his name):nl:nlMr. Bennet: At last, I have caught you, now tell me, where is your boss?:nl:nl???: …:nl:nlMr. Bennet: Your silence is remarkable, but I advise you to speak, or I will be forced to jump on your head for the third time.:nl:nl???: …\\Mr. Bennet: I admire your loyalty to your boss, it’s almost as impressive as your ability to solicit with minors.:nl:nl???: So what? That’s normal.:nl:nlMr. Bennet: Underaged boys?!?:nl:nl???: Okay I’ll talk, I’ll talk, He took her to London.:nl:nlMr. Bennet: Thank you, I have all the information I require, I shall take my leave.:nl:nl(Allows ??? to escape)\\Mr. Bennet: I see no reason why his behavior should not be revealed to the public...:nl:nl(Mr. Bennet runs off in the direction indicated by the man that he still has not bothered to ask the name of)"
        }}]},
        
